<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #0B1220 0%, #16233D 100%)', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>
    {/* A 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 16, alignItems: 'flex-start', paddingTop: 6 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 36, background: '#2AD4EE', marginTop: 5 }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 3, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>DESIGN POINT 05 · 续</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.38)', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>· 插话与停止</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ marginTop: 6, fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF9' }}>插话不打断，停止靠原语</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 516, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 452, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>

            {/* 左：队列 */}
            <Box style={{ width: 640, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2.5, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>PendingMessageQueue · 两种姿势</Text>

                <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.14)', paddingBottom: 6 }}>
                    <Text style={{ width: 108, fontSize: 11.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.38)', letterSpacing: 1 }}>维度</Text>
                    <Text style={{ width: 200, fontSize: 11.5, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 1 }}>steer 转向</Text>
                    <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 11.5, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 1 }}>followUp 追问</Text>
                </Box>
                {[
                    ['进队时机', 'agent 正在跑', 'agent 空闲 / run 尾声'],
                    ['语义', '纠偏当前任务：别用方案 A，改用 B', '追问或接续：好，那再加测试'],
                    ['UI', '/steer 命令，或输入框直接打字', '输入框直接打字'],
                ].map((r, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 7, paddingBottom: 7, borderBottom: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.07)' }}>
                        <Text style={{ width: 108, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.46)' }}>{r[0]}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ width: 200, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.84)' }}>{r[1]}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 12.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.84)' }}>{r[2]}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}

                <Text style={{ marginTop: 16, fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.46)' }}>生效方式只取决于「消息进队时,循环还活着没有」</Text>

                <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7 }}>
                    {[
                        ['内层在跑 · steer', '内层消费', '当前这轮说完，下一个 turn 边界注入，任务继续'],
                        ['内层在跑 · run 尾声的 followUp', '内层消费', '同样在 turn 边界注入 —— run 并不会结束'],
                        ['内层已退出 · 空闲期的 followUp', '外层消费', '作为新输入续跑，这就是「答完接着聊」'],
                    ].map((r, i) => (
                        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, paddingLeft: 12, paddingRight: 12, background: i === 2 ? 'rgba(42,212,238,0.10)' : 'rgba(22,35,61,0.62)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.14)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                            <Text style={{ width: 232, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.80)' }}>{r[0]}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ width: 76, fontSize: 11.5, color: '#2AD4EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{r[1]}</Text>
                            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.62)', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{r[2]}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>

                <Text style={{ marginTop: 10, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.50)', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    两种姿势的区别只在进队时机与语义标签，生效机制完全相同：都是往 messages 里加一条 UserMessage，模型只看到「上下文里多了你的话」。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            {/* 右：停止原语 */}
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2.5, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>四类停止原语</Text>

                <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                    {[
                        { k: 'stopReason', d: '模型自己说停：stop 说完 / length 到长度 / toolUse 要调工具 / error / aborted / deferred', h: '模型' },
                        { k: 'shouldStopAfterTurn', d: '每个 turn 结束问一次宿主「还要继续吗」——预算、时间、外部信号都在这叫停', h: '宿主' },
                        { k: 'abort()', d: '硬中断当前运行（用户 Esc）；waitForIdle() 等运行与监听器全部沉淀后收尾', h: '用户' },
                        { k: '截断保护', d: 'stopReason = length 时，全部 tool call 直接标记失败，绝不执行半截 JSON', h: '兜底' },
                    ].map((r, i) => (
                        <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, paddingLeft: 13, paddingRight: 13, background: 'rgba(22,35,61,0.72)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,249,0.10)', borderRadius: 3 }}>
                            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
                                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#2AD4EE', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{r.k}</Text>
                                <Text style={{ marginLeft: 'auto', fontSize: 10.5, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.38)' }}>{r.h}</Text>
                            </Box>
                            <Text style={{ marginTop: 4, fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.66)', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>{r.d}</Text>
                        </Box>
                    ))}
                </Box>

                <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, paddingTop: 10, paddingBottom: 10, paddingLeft: 13, paddingRight: 13, borderLeft: '3px solid #2AD4EE', background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.06)' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.74)', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                        工具层默认不重试：失败返回 isError 回喂模型，下一步由模型决定。要给外部 API 加 500 重试，在 execute 内做退避（记得接 signal），或用 tool_result 钩子改写错误引导重试。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        {/* 底部 */}
        <Box style={{ height: 52, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18, background: 'rgba(42,212,238,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(42,212,238,0.22)', borderRadius: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2AD4EE', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>所以</Text>
            <Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EEF9', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                「打断」不是杀死进程，而是把话塞进队列——上下文不断裂，不需要任何恢复逻辑。想真停就用 abort，语义彻底分开。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)' }}>从 LLM 到 Agent 再到 Pi Agent</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,238,249,0.42)', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>33 / 46</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
